title: "NZ ETS Forest Land - Spatial Eligibility Screening"
abstract: "An auditable Python/GeoPandas workflow for screening potential post-1989 forest-land opportunities in Gisborne District against the subset of NZ ETS forest-land criteria testable from open spatial data. Screening/triage only; not an eligibility determination."
type: software
authors:
